  "releaseNotes": "# Gecko.NCore.Client.Functions.V1\nClient proxies and adapters for the Functions V1 service in Elements Integration Services (EIS).\n\n## `8.0.1`\n- Require Gecko.NCore.Client 12.0.1 or later, which bundles the authentication client assembly.\n\n## `8.0.0`\n- Target .NET 10.0 only; .NET 8.0 is no longer supported.\n- Add token-based authentication for Functions V1 service clients, supporting client credentials and on-behalf-of-user authentication through the shared client factory.\n- Require Gecko.NCore.Client 12.0.0 or later.\n\nFor authentication setup and usage, see the package page on [NuGet.org](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Gecko.NCore.Client).",
